 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” HVAC company for every Phoenix home, but **Champion Air** is a reasonable first call: its Phoenix AC-repair page advertises emergency service, licensing and insurance, and lists Arizona ROC license **#328617**. You could also compare quotes with **CUBIRI A/C** or **Air Speed Heating and Air Conditioning**, which appear in the BBB’s Phoenix AC-repair listings with A+ ratings.\n\nBefore booking, check recent reviews and confirm the contractor’s Arizona license is active with the Registrar of Contractors. Ask about the diagnostic fee, whether it’s credited toward the repair, and get the repair price in writing before authorizing work.",
